	Well I found the cause of the Bus Errors.

	That Statue/Boulder!?!
	Playing in discovery/wizard mode all I have to do is give myself
a statue or a boulder and my game is history the next time I list my inventory.

	It doesn't stop there however.  I have to be playing the game on my
PC 25 line terminal emulator.  A real terminal does not crash.

	We have 3 basic types of terminals here:
1.	AT&T 615 terminals connected via data switch (ISN)
2.	Telex (sync) terminals connected via 3174 async port to ISN.
3.	PC emulator (EmOTS (AT&T product)) via STARLAN network.

I have already tested and pretty much eliminated the device type as the cause. 
The first two are 24 line and the emulator for the PC is 25 line.

	God knows what the connection is here between nethack statues and
terminal type/terminfo entry, but I dig until I find it.

						Keeping the net posted
